[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5281.59, "timestamp": "01:28:01", "text": "一起參加Joathon活動的人，他們完全了解我的情況，呃，是的，他們中的一些人發現了這件事，呃，選擇和我保持聯繫，呃，站在我這邊，希望看到我做得更好，他們也願意在未來繼續"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5285.99, "timestamp": "01:28:05", "text": "合作"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5296.149, "timestamp": "01:28:16", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5298.629, "timestamp": "01:28:18", "text": "所以我對此感到很興奮。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5303.91, "timestamp": "01:28:23", "text": "所以，是的，我經常聽到「合作」這個詞。它到底是什麼意思？是不同的主播"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5306.629, "timestamp": "01:28:26", "text": "之間簽約一起直播嗎？好吧，有兩種"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5320.31, "timestamp": "01:28:40", "text": "方式。我來說說我理解的。好吧，既然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5327.35, "timestamp": "01:28:47", "text": "你想開始直播什麼的，對吧？合作。合作這個詞指的是兩個創作者合作，或是出現在同一個直播間一起做"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5328.884, "timestamp": "01:28:48", "author": "@nuclearmaidch", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MS3mIduhKynDUQHTdAP09smm9-S_B6gqCjrteh5PLq8oahJNV_6F7Nz1MLSlqRPjz4ot-KSp-8Y=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Partnering together for some shared goals?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5329.51, "timestamp": "01:28:49", "text": "內容，對吧？說到YouTube主播的合作，"}]